<div type="mainBody">
<p>Steady improvement since Saturday <seg xml:id="seg1" type="note-anchor">hope to be well</seg> end of week greetings <name type="person" key="joyc82">James Joyce</name>
                    </p>
</div>
</div>

<div type="notes">
<note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">In spite of his health challenges throughout the summer of 1922, <name type="person" key="joyc82">JJ</name> hoped for improvement in time for his visit to <name type="geo" key="G_GBR_LOND">London</name> in the coming days.</note>
</div>

